   "en": "Go outside",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES35:13b70",
   "off": 80752,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「魔法のアイテムは\r  使うタイミングが大事」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"With magic items, timing is everything.\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES35:13ba2",
   "off": 80802,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「私も早く逃げなくちゃ\r  いけないんだけど…」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"I really ought to get out of here soon too, but...\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES35:13bd9",
   "off": 80857,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "さて､どんな御用ですか？",
   "en": "Now, what can I do for you?",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES35:13c0c",
   "off": 80908,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「南地区の医療聖堂で\r  何か起きているらしい\u0010\b  外部の者を入れようと\r  しないんだ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Something's going on at the Temple of Medicine in the South District.\u0010\bThey won't let any outsiders in.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES35:13c65",
   "off": 80997,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「ホムンクリって 知って\r  ます？ 人間が造り出した\r  生命ですよ\u0010\b  医療聖堂が造っているって\r  噂もあるけど…\u0010\b  本当なら恐ろしい\r  話ですよね…」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Have you heard of Homunculi? They're life created by human hands.\u0010\bThere's a rumour the Temple of Medicine is making them...\u0010\bIf it's true, it's a frightening thought...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
 ]
}
